  "party_cases_comment": "Game-system checks evaluated against the party (VTT's rpg_systems; the wiki only reports needs_check and checks these cases' shape). party is each player character's held options, {dimension: [slugs]}. A char leaf is met when any (who: any, the default) or every (who: all) party member holds, for every dimension it names, at least one of its values; otherwise unmet. Then the all/any rule above applies, with resolved hooks as before.",
